    <name>
      <text>15.2 Simultaneous equations one linear, one quadratic</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Solve these simultaneous equations using the steps below</p>
<p>\[{@Eqn1@} \quad [i]\]</p>
<p>\[{@Eqn2@} \quad [ii]\]</p>
<p>a). Substitute equation \(ii\) into equation \(i\)  to obtain a quadratic equation just with \(x\) only. We will call this equation \(iii\) .</p>
<p>[[input:ans1]] \(\quad [iii]\) [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</p>
<p>b). Solve the quadratic.</p>
<p>\(x = \) [[input:ans2]] or \(x = \) [[input:ans3]] [[validation:ans2]]  [[validation:ans3]] [[feedback:prt2]]</p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
